{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:48:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_b0295b7d08794eebb3c1a97721ba03b8","id":"pg_c65b8f9515075c299a315c3675e50df4","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/emrgnt-cmplxty-automata-docs-config-config-base-config-rst-316386a2ea5-5c3675e50df4.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_f4a0afab491a596ca71aeaf6039574d4"],"title":"emrgnt-cmplxty/automata/docs/config/config_base/config.rst @ 316386a2ea5b","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:48:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b0295b7d08794eebb3c1a97721ba03b8"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_1081b78582db481837b5c1291c68b5fbd23ab049048203e646bf065556f34a2e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Automata Search requires SCIP indices, which build a code graph relating symbols by dependencies; new indices are generated periodically and users may need to generate them manually for local development."},{"claim_ids":["clm_43e379b31b240f9e3e7bf7f40e9e0a2d6c217e8f24540ff918d6dfea559294b4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The system combines large language models such as GPT-4 with a vector database to document, search, and write code, forming the basis of its self-coding potential."},{"claim_ids":["clm_53f2661cb03643611bf2ba4cac75f59f373f92de40a1d681bd146b1f3cb806de"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors are directed to review CONTRIBUTING.md and a code of conduct, with GitHub issues for bugs and Discussions for general questions."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6b974e0d9f4385f3780b3bbdb0d47e9644d509ed4358053da3d918be6f87cc38"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: setup involves cloning, initializing git submodules, installing via poetry, and running automata configure; Docker installation is also documented, and Windows users may need C++ build tools and gcc-11/g++-11."},{"claim_ids":["clm_748309999bd42126656b07956940a61515bf55088a5c85d93ef72ed2de4243a2"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A Python API lets users build an OpenAIAutomataAgent from a named config (e.g. 'automata-main'), attach factory-built tools, and run it with instructions via agent.run()."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9f3f7ba7e9352de750866c46f451dc2220b6786d763b852257ee880b0587bbfe"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Automata's stated goal is to become a fully autonomous, self-programming AI system, based on the idea that code is a form of memory that lets AI evolve real-time capabilities."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b22474d246151d7c9b7439b12dbf6c59b686e813a9991bcf33861ddf71cb333b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product exposes a CLI via poetry, including commands like automata configure, install-indexing, run-code-embedding, run-doc-embedding, and run-agent with an --instructions flag."},{"claim_ids":["clm_cd48e3de9055f3e69d33a5de85e1fec0dc54a1fccbe440873b5f0095cddc12a0"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Symbol embeddings are represented by classes such as SymbolCodeEmbedding (code-related) and SymbolDocEmbedding (documentation-related), storing a symbol plus a high-dimensional vector."}],"claim_ids":["clm_1081b78582db481837b5c1291c68b5fbd23ab049048203e646bf065556f34a2e","clm_43e379b31b240f9e3e7bf7f40e9e0a2d6c217e8f24540ff918d6dfea559294b4","clm_53f2661cb03643611bf2ba4cac75f59f373f92de40a1d681bd146b1f3cb806de","clm_6b974e0d9f4385f3780b3bbdb0d47e9644d509ed4358053da3d918be6f87cc38","clm_748309999bd42126656b07956940a61515bf55088a5c85d93ef72ed2de4243a2","clm_9f3f7ba7e9352de750866c46f451dc2220b6786d763b852257ee880b0587bbfe","clm_b22474d246151d7c9b7439b12dbf6c59b686e813a9991bcf33861ddf71cb333b","clm_cd48e3de9055f3e69d33a5de85e1fec0dc54a1fccbe440873b5f0095cddc12a0"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:48:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_b0295b7d08794eebb3c1a97721ba03b8","id":"pg_dff7e9eda4565b3f9c632e4c9c903082","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/emrgnt-cmplxty-automata-readme-md-316386a2ea5b-2e4c9c903082.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_7d79e14c31895a51ab23d641224b5a1e"],"title":"emrgnt-cmplxty/automata/README.md @ 316386a2ea5b","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:48:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b0295b7d08794eebb3c1a97721ba03b8"}
